    "The prepared Core recipe snapshots each caller-supplied current header once, then validates input shape bounds/body extents without closing schemas. Constants and repeated output axes remain live checks. The full output shape is instantiated and exact child keys/shapes remain enforced at canonical publication.",
    "Existing private-frame and scalar strategies keep priority. The actual sealed numeric CompositePack route retains all ordinary source envelopes; schema-only normalization is prepared once. No native arithmetic or FP instruction selection changes.",
    "Five new Core differential tests cover fresh rectangular/zero extents, independent parameter arenas, constants/repeated axes, arity/schema substitution, bounded input parameters, computed input overflow, declined unsupported output relations, canonicalization and exact publication bits. Every failed attempt remains; no benchmark timing preceded qualification.",
    "Exactly one prospective v2 optimization15 probe retains seven fresh processes per actor/case and all210 observations. A successful probe is not promotion; both frozen formal primary scores must strictly improve accepted31."
